  "details": "Description\n\nMouse clicks have completely stopped responding, affecting both UI elements and interactable in-game objects. All other controls—including keyboard movement, toggling the microphone, and opening the Action Menu (R key)—are functioning normally.\n\nI have already tried standard troubleshooting steps, such as disabling overlay software (Discord, Steam, etc.) and clearing the game cache files, but the issue persists.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nLaunch VRChat in Desktop mode.\n\nAttempt to left-click or right-click on any UI button or in-game interactable object.\n\nObserve that the clicks register no response, while keyboard input (WASD), mic toggling, and the quick menu/wheel menu (R key) continue to work properly.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: 其他\n\n- Frequency: 總是\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p1-1920-5a72154dad-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-08_00-16-40.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_1ff9f851-8db7-4683-aea6-9295144b1b50/1/file)",
